
Thresholds

   List of gray intensities from 0 to 255. These intensities will be
   used to separate background as white (0) and foreground as black (1)

Min-Max Pixel Width

   Maximum width of targets (3 a 7)

Min-Max Pixel Height

   Maximum width of targets (3 a 7)

Min-Max Num Pixel

   Maximum width of targets (10 a 100)

Min Pixel Density

   Density inside bounding box of target black island (0.5)

Angle Tolerance

   Found targets need to be at a certain tolerance range

Min Side

   Target distance

